  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2902.07 Grant Review Committee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2902.07 “Grant Review Committee” means the colonel of the New Hampshire state police or designee, the president of the New Hampshire association of chiefs of police or designee, and the president of the New Hampshire sheriffs association or designee.\n\nSource. #13230, eff 7-9-21",
